  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ataliya nyina wa Ahaziya abonye ko umuhungu wiwe apfuye, arahaguruka ngo atikize umuryango w’umwami wose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Yehosheba umukobwa w’umwami Yoramu akaba na mushiki wa Ahaziya, aca afata Yowashi mwene Ahaziya aramunyuruza, amukuye mu bandi bana b’umwami bagira bicwe, amunyegeza mu cumba co kuryamamwo ari kumwe n’umurezi wiwe, kugira ngo amuhishe Ataliya, uko ni ko yarokotse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowashi n’umurezi wiwe bamara imyaka itandatu banyegejwe mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mu gihe Ataliya ari we yatwara ico gihugu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira indwi, Yehoyada umuherezi atumako intwazangabo zitwara abasoda ijanijana, abo mu Bakariti, n’abarinzi bo ku kirimba, abajana mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Agiriranira isezerano na bo, aranabarahiza bari mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Hanyuma, aca abereka wa mwana w’umwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada ababwira ati: “Ibi ni vyo mukwiye gukora: mwebwe abari mu migwi itatu izoba iramukiwe gukora kw’Isabato, umugwi wa mbere uzocungera ikirimba c’umwami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umugwi wa kabiri ucungere Irembo rya Suri, uwa gatatu na wo uhagarare inyuma y’abacunze ikirimba. Iyo migwi yose uko ari itatu izoza irakuranwa mu gucungera ingoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe abari mu yindi migwi ibiri itazoba ifise ibikorwa vyo kw’Isabato, muzocungera umwami mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzohagarare mukikuje umwami, mufise ibigwanisho mu maboko yanyu. Nihagira uwegera aho muri azokwicwe. Muzogume hafi y’umwami aho azoja hose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izo ntwazangabo zirongoye ingabo ijanijana zibikora nk’uko Yehoyada umuherezi yabibabwiye. Umwe wese ahitana abantu biwe, baba abari baramukiwe kuja ku bikorwa vyo kw’Isabato, canke abari bagombowe, bose babazana imbere ya Yehoyada umuherezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we abaha amacumu n’inkinzo vyari ivy’umwami Dawidi, vyari vyabitswe mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Za ngabo, umwe wese afise ikigwanisho mu minwe, zikikuza umwami; hafi y’igicaniro n’Ingoro, kuva mu bumanuko ukaja mu buraruko bw’Ingoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada aca asohokana umwana w’umwami amwambika urugori, amushikiriza n’ikopi y’ivyagezwe vy’Uhoraho, maze amenyesha ko abaye umwami. Bamusukako amavuta mu kumwimika, abari ngaho bose bakomera amashi rimwe, bavuga bati: “Umwami nahangame!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Ataliya yumvise urwamo rw’ingabo n’abandi bantu, aca aja iyo bari mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aravye, abona umwami, ahagaze hafi y’inkingi nk’uko umugenzo wari uri. Intwazangabo n’abavuza inzamba bari i ruhande yiwe, abantu bose bo mu gihugu bariko baranezerwa bavuza inzamba. Maze Ataliya yitaburirako impuzu arasemerera ati: “Uwo ni umugararizo! Uwo ni umugararizo!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuherezi Yehoyada aca abwira intwazangabo zitwara abasoda ijanijana ati: “Nimumusohore hanze mumucishe hagati y’imirongo y’ingabo kandi mwicishe inkota uwomukurikira wese,” kuko yari yavuze ati: “Ntiyicirwe mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko baramufata bamucisha mw’irembo ry’amafarasi rija ku mbuga y’ingoro y’umwami, bamwiciraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada aca agiriranira isezerano n’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " hamwe n’umwami n’abantu, ko bazoba abantu b’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Yongera ashiraho isezerano hagati y’umwami n’abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bose b’ico gihugu baca baja ku ngoro ya Bayali barayisenyagura. Basitagura ibicaniro n’ibigirwamana bicika ivu, bafata Matani umuherezi wa Bayali, bamwicira imbere y’ibicaniro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze umuherezi Yehoyada agena abantu bacungera Ingoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma ahitana za ntwazangabo z’abasoda ijanijana, ba bacangero b’Abakariti, abacungera ikirimba hamwe n’abantu bose bo muri ico gihugu, bakura umwami mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " bamutwara ku kirimba, yinjirana irembo ryarimwo abasoda bamucungera. Umwami abona kwicara mu kibanza ciwe ku ntebe y’ubwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abari aho bose bagira umunezero, n’igisagara kiba amahoro kuko Ataliya yari yamaze kwicishwa inkota muri ico kirimba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowashi yari afise imyaka indwi igihe yaba umwami.",
